@startuml Proxy_CachingUserRepository
' If any modifications are done to the classes participating in this pattern,
' this diagram must be updated accordingly.

title Proxy Pattern — CachingUserRepositoryProxy

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FEFECE
  BorderColor #A80036
}

note as N1
  <b>PROXY (Structural)</b>
  CachingUserRepositoryProxy (Proxy) implements
  IUserRepository and forwards calls to
  SqliteUserRepository (RealSubject) only on cache misses.
  Banned/timed-out user records are cached with a 30s TTL,
  avoiding a DB round-trip on every Telegram message.
  On UpdateAsync(), the cache entry is invalidated.
end note

interface IUserRepository << Subject >> {
  + GetOrCreateAsync(telegramId, ct) : Task<User>
  + UpdateAsync(user, ct) : Task
  + ResetAsync(telegramId, ct) : Task
  + ClearAllAsync(ct) : Task<int>
}

class SqliteUserRepository << RealSubject >> {
  - _connectionString : string
  + GetOrCreateAsync(telegramId, ct) : Task<User>
  + UpdateAsync(user, ct) : Task
  + ResetAsync(telegramId, ct) : Task
  + ClearAllAsync(ct) : Task<int>
}

class CachingUserRepositoryProxy << Proxy >> {
  - inner : IUserRepository
  - cache : IMemoryCache
  - {static} CacheTtl : TimeSpan = 30s
  + GetOrCreateAsync(telegramId, ct) : Task<User>
  + UpdateAsync(user, ct) : Task
  + ResetAsync(telegramId, ct) : Task
  + ClearAllAsync(ct) : Task<int>
}

note bottom of CachingUserRepositoryProxy
  On hit → returns cached User.
  On miss → delegates to RealSubject,
  stores result with 30s TTL.
  UpdateAsync() and ResetAsync() both
  remove the individual cache entry.
  ClearAllAsync() delegates only —
  30s TTL handles natural expiry.
end note

class UserService << Client >> {
  + GetOrCreateAsync(telegramId, ct) : Task<User>
  + ApplyStrikeAsync(telegramId, ct) : Task
  + TimeoutAsync(telegramId, hours, ct) : Task
  + BanAsync(telegramId, ct) : Task
  + UnbanAsync(telegramId, ct) : Task
  + ResetUserAsync(telegramId, ct) : Task
  + ClearAllUsersAsync(ct) : Task<int>
}

IUserRepository         <|.. SqliteUserRepository
IUserRepository         <|.. CachingUserRepositoryProxy
CachingUserRepositoryProxy --> SqliteUserRepository : inner (delegates on miss)
UserService             ..> IUserRepository : <<uses>>

@enduml
